  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialManager
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 1057234025}
  tutorialText: {fileID: 1995343176}
  tutorialImage: {fileID: 590035975}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1056615037}
  closeButton: {fileID: 321150606}
  pages:
  - "Welcome to your shift. Your objective is to accurately evaluate, diagnose, and
    treat your scheduled patients.\n\nCONTROLS:\n\u2022 [W][A][S][D] - Move around
    the clinic\n\u2022 [E] - Interact with patients and objects\n\u2022 [ESC] - Open
    the Pause Menu"
  - 'During a consultation, read carefully before responding. Every choice you make
    actively impacts four core metrics: Clinical Reasoning, Information Gathering,
    Empathy, and Patient Safety.


    If you need to review the patient''s vitals
    or background, click the ''Case File'' button on your screen at any time.'
  - "After seeing your patients, your overall shift will be graded on a strict scale:\n\u2022
    Exemplary (18-20 pts)\n\u2022 Proficient (15-17 pts)\n\u2022 Developing (12-14
    pts)\n\u2022 Beginning (9-11 pts)\n\u2022 Unsatisfactory (0-8 pts)\n\nExceptional
    performance in specific metrics will unlock permanent achievement badges for
    your profile. Good luck, Doctor!"
  pageImages:
  - {fileID: 7340948272652233546, guid: 94413071c9fc1104bbd7f4855e98ded3, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: b14c53d5d14b2a64aa0f46910413f579, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 0}
